                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "5fcc7dcb-9e92-35c6-bbe5-fc0ab9f358ad",
                        "entry_id": "986eed5c-6389-38b0-9c85-e7937f552b99",
                        "glosses": [
                            "раковина с краном или специальный сосуд с краном, носиком и т. п., служащий для умывания"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "fbbee4cd-202b-45a1-950e-ddfe6d8cfecd",
                                "sense_id": "5fcc7dcb-9e92-35c6-bbe5-fc0ab9f358ad",
                                "text": "Кухарка между тем достала из-под кровати таз с огромным умывальником. Распустив совершенно капот-распашонку, Татьяна Ивановна первоначально натёрла зубы угольным порошком, выполоскала их потом и вслед за тем принялась обмывать руки, лицо и даже грудь."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "52fd890c-f405-4028-a600-c197dcdfcbea",
                                "sense_id": "5fcc7dcb-9e92-35c6-bbe5-fc0ab9f358ad",
                                "text": "Он стоял и умывался перед глиняным умывальником .."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "971a0905-d6e5-47f1-99ed-66cdbfb4d180",
                                "sense_id": "5fcc7dcb-9e92-35c6-bbe5-fc0ab9f358ad",
                                "text": "Он, сняв китель, подставив обросшую волосами красную шею под струю умывальника, растирал её и голову руками."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "129135b6-7ebc-47cc-8747-c67df0838555",
                        "source_entry_id": "986eed5c-6389-38b0-9c85-e7937f552b99",
                        "source_sense_id": "5fcc7dcb-9e92-35c6-bbe5-fc0ab9f358ad",
                        "target_lang_word": "washstand",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "washstand",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "772ffa0f-b309-3eea-a2c9-e2c7db7650ad",
                                        "entry_id": "178cfac5-edda-38bf-a1ce-23183c197eb8",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A table containing a basin and a pitcher of water for washing."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1a798cd0-a1ce-4384-8ad7-9cc18bf4ca78",
                                                "sense_id": "772ffa0f-b309-3eea-a2c9-e2c7db7650ad",
                                                "text": "The less quality the more saleable they were. An abhorrent-looking stained oak wash-stand with a marble top and inset tiles, or a sideboard with bevelled mirrors in the back, or an enamelled wardrobe with stamped wood panels were much preferred to comparatively innocuous examples of the same articles in plain wood."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "8e907d0a-64f2-396b-9c74-5f0b57426fcb",
                                        "entry_id": "178cfac5-edda-38bf-a1ce-23183c197eb8",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "In a stable or garage, a place in the floor prepared so that carriages or automobiles may be washed there and the water run off."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "dated"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d7f508b4-a2fa-4a89-bfc8-68335c91a2e5",
                                                "sense_id": "8e907d0a-64f2-396b-9c74-5f0b57426fcb",
                                                "text": "Washstand in an Electric Garage. […] In a few garages arrangements are made for washing cars in any position on the storage floor, so that it is not necessary to move them on to and off the washrack."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
